# AgentFlow RL v2

Independent language-only rewrite of the GSM8K and sandbox ticket experiments using LangGraph and a custom TRL turn-level GSPO adapter.

The implementation preserves query-group trajectory advantages, real Planner token IDs, Planner-only LoRA updates, binary task rewards, and controlled baseline/adapter evaluation. It intentionally fixes sampling/log-probability consistency and does not include an SFT stage.

Implementation is proceeding checkpoint by checkpoint with strict red-green-refactor TDD. See `NOTICE`, `THIRD_PARTY_NOTICES.md`, and `LICENSES/AgentFlow-MIT.txt` for source provenance.

